    "commentsEn": "<ul>\r\n\t<li>Saudi Chevron Phillips (SCP) is equally owned by Saudi Industrial Investment Group (SIIG) and Arabian Chevron Petrochemical Company Ltd. (ACPC).</li>\r\n\t<li>The company announced that the project started commercial operation in 2008.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
